<BaseLayout showNewsletter={false} noindex title="Thanks for signing up | Glenn Edley" description="What to expect from MondayMotivator, Glenn Edley's weekly email, and a few places to start reading.">
  <main class="landing-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">MondayMotivator · Since 2004</p>
    <h1>Thanks for signing up.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Here's to starting your week with something to think about.</p>

    <h2>What to expect</h2>
    <p>MondayMotivator is my weekly email about life, mindset and what I'm learning in business and marketing. A thought, an opinion or a useful question to help you see things differently.</p>
    <p>I've been writing it since 2004. Expect one email a week, with the occasional extra when something exciting happens. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>

    <h2>While you're here</h2>
    <p>You don't have to wait until Monday to start reading. There are years of ideas and stories in <a href="/mondaymotivator/">the MondayMotivator archive</a>.</p>
    <p>Not sure where to begin? Explore <a href="/four-factors/">the Four Factors</a>: Belief, Programming the Mind, Mental Posture and Focus. Or take a look at <a href="/mondaymotivator/">my other writing</a>, including <em>Light Your Own Fire</em>.</p>

    <h2>Keep in touch</h2>
    <p>You can also find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/glennedley/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://x.com/glennedley" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a>.</p>
    <p>Thanks for reading.</p>
    <p>Glenn</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
